{"ticker":"NKE","updated":"2026-10-23T23:22:49Z","profile":{"longName":"NIKE, Inc.","shortName":"Nike, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Footwear & Accessories","country":"United States","website":"https://www.nike.com","fullTimeEmployees":73000,"marketCap":55402016768,"trailingPE":17.932693,"forwardPE":23.397608,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.2072524,"pegRatio":3.24,"targetMeanPrice":36.5,"targetHighPrice":60.0,"targetLowPrice":19.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":37,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.043,"earningsGrowth":-0.021,"grossMargins":0.43407002,"operatingMargins":0.07919,"profitMargins":0.0674,"totalRevenue":45890998272,"beta":1.099,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":70.44,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":31.97,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.28},"summary":"NIKE, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, designs, develops, markets, and sells athletic footwear, apparel, equipment, accessories, and services for men, women, and kids in North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Greater China, the Asia Pacific, and Latin America. The company offers its products under the NIKE, Jordan, Converse, Jumpman, Chuck Taylor, All Star, One Star, Star Chevron, and Jack Purcell trademarks. It also provides a line of performance equipment and accessories, including bags, socks, sport balls, eyewear, timepieces, digital devices, bats, gloves, protective equipment, and other equipment for sports activities; and sports apparel, as well as sells products to wholesale customers and directly to consumers through NIKE Direct operations; distributes and licenses casual sneakers, apparel, and accessories; and markets apparel with licensed college and professional team and league logos. In addition, the company offers consumer services and experiences, including sport focused events and activations; fitness and activity apps; sport, fitness, and wellness content; and digital services and features in retail stores. It sells its products to footwear stores; sporting goods stores; athletic specialty stores; department stores; skate, tennis, and golf shops; and other wholesale accounts through NIKE-owned retail stores, independent distributors, licensees, sal","summary_zh":"耐吉公司及其子公司為北美、歐洲、中東、非洲、大中華區、亞太地區和拉丁美洲的男士、女士和兒童設計、開發、行銷和銷售運動鞋、服裝、裝備、配件和服務。該公司以 NIKE、Jordan、Converse、Jumpman、Chuck Taylor、All Star、One Star、Star Chevron 和 Jack Purcell 商標提供產品。它還提供一系列表演裝備和配件，包括包、襪子、運動球、眼鏡、鐘錶、數位設備、球棒、手套、防護裝備和其他體育活動裝備；和運動服裝，並向批發客戶銷售產品，並通過 NIKE Direct 運營直接向消費者銷售產品；分銷和休閒運動鞋、服裝和配飾並獲得許可；並銷售帶有大學標誌的大學標誌此外，該公司還提供消費者服務和體驗，包括以體育為重點的活動和活動；健身和活動應用程式；運動、健身和健康內容；以及零售商店的數位服務和功能。其產品銷往鞋店；運動用品店；運動專賣店；百貨公司；滑板店、網球店和高爾夫店；以及透過Nike擁有的零售店、獨立經銷商、被授權人、銷售人員的其他批發帳戶","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"鞋類及配件","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":78.47,"h":80.17,"l":78.39,"c":79.17,"v":12488900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":79.0,"h":79.48,"l":78.38,"c":78.65,"v":6874800},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":78.96,"h":79.51,"l":77.65,"c":78.06,"v":12636700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":78.58,"h":78.66,"l":77.72,"c":77.92,"v":7478600},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":77.75,"h":79.13,"l":77.12,"c":77.37,"v":14208800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":75.64,"h":76.05,"l":74.0,"c":74.29,"v":15078700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":74.4,"h":75.18,"l":73.91,"c":74.74,"v":8300100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":74.75,"h":75.77,"l":74.51,"c":75.35,"v":11096200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":74.8,"h":75.41,"l":73.63,"c":73.91,"v":13758400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":74.26,"h":74.58,"l":73.71,"c":74.15,"v":13793300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":73.99,"h":74.55,"l":73.05,"c":73.6,"v":8740200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":75.25,"h":75.46,"l":73.33,"c":74.25,"v":11359300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":74.41,"h":75.53,"l":74.01,"c":74.33,"v":9803400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":74.24,"h":74.28,"l":71.93,"c":73.0,"v":11806000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":73.18,"h":73.21,"l":72.58,"c":73.03,"v":10323800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":72.8,"h":73.38,"l":72.09,"c":72.75,"v":8813600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":73.07,"h":73.32,"l":71.61,"c":72.31,"v":11108700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":73.44,"h":73.6,"l":71.63,"c":72.1,